            "question": "In which languages is the book available?",
            "answer": "<p>The book is available in English, Hindi, and Gujarati, ensuring accessibility to readers across different regions and preferences.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Vi8Cae": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What sizes are available for the book?",
            "answer": "<p>The book comes in three sizes: pocket size for convenience, A4 size for easy reading, and a larger size for an immersive experience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gQF4tY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I pre-book the Hanuman Chalisa book?",
            "answer": "<p>You can pre-book directly on our website through the pre-booking section. Limited copies are available, so don’t miss the opportunity!</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jgcN8W": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are Art Combos, and how can I purchase them?",
            "answer": "<p>Art Combos are coloring pages featuring the beautiful illustrations from the book. You can purchase these combos on our website and enjoy the meditative joy of coloring divine artworks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3LtXbn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I track my shipment across India?",
            "answer": "<p>Once you place your order, we’ll send you a confirmation email with tracking details. You can also check the status through the “Track Your Order” section on our website.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7Tc64x": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are there any discounts or offers available?",
            "answer": "<p>We occasionally run special offers for our customers. Check the homepage or subscribe to our newsletter for updates on discounts and exclusive deals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MA8UN3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I gift this book to someone?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! The Hanuman Chalisa book makes a thoughtful gift. Just mention the recipient’s details at checkout, and we’ll take care of the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qT4MRg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Currently, we ship within India, but we are working on expanding our delivery options to international locations. Stay tuned for updates!</p>"
          }
        },
